# HTTP API

Start the service with `just serve`, or build the image with `docker build -t {{ distribution_name }} .`. Granian
serves the Litestar app on port 8000. Litestar writes the OpenAPI schema at `/schema`.

| Route | Method | Response |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `/health` | `GET` | `{"status": "ok", "version": "<version>"}` |

